WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.860
You like Figma.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.460
You like Claude.

3
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.440
Meet Maude.

4
00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.560
Draw it yourself, or just ask.

5
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.640
The AI draws right on the canvas while you watch.

6
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.380
Don't like it?

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.040
One undo takes the whole thing back.

8
00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.760
And here's the part that matters.

9
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.340
Your design isn't locked in a secret format.

10
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.180
It's plain web code, the language AI grew up on.

11
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.580
So the AI is fluent in it, and a developer can ship it as it is.

12
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.840
Screens, reels, slides and print.

13
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.080
A design system from a moodboard.

14
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.700
Your whole team, live, on one canvas.

15
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.180
Maude Cloud puts your project online for everyone.

16
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.000
You pay for the project, never per seat.

17
00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.040
Maude. Built around AI, not bent to fit one.

18
00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:58.760
Free to download at maude.sh.

